[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m test would have missed.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Fix.** `translation/src/main.rs` now restores the default disposition as the
